1
00:00:01,890 --> 00:00:07,720
Living Market can also help you pick and size a trade.

2
00:00:07,820 --> 00:00:11,650
Click the line between two currencies to pick that pair.

3
00:00:11,750 --> 00:00:16,510
The narration explains, in plain words, what that pair is doing.

4
00:00:16,610 --> 00:00:20,370
The pair appears in the action card at the bottom.

5
00:00:20,470 --> 00:00:25,230
Conviction sets how big the trade is. The size in lots is shown here.

6
00:00:25,330 --> 00:00:29,590
Then Buy or Sell trades that pair at that size.

7
00:00:29,690 --> 00:00:34,450
Clicking another line switches to a different pair.

